<tr><td style="padding:24px 32px 32px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px">
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">The light changes in October, and so does the garden. This week: what to leave standing for the birds, a short guide to dividing perennials, and the one tool we would buy again.</p>
<h2 class="section">Leave it standing</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Seed heads feed finches well into winter. Cut back only what is diseased or falling over.</p>
<h2 class="section">Divide in cool weather</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Lift the clump, split it with two forks back to back, and replant the outer pieces.</p>
